{
"file": 115,
"paths": [
"d007/d003/f301"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "b71edacc",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "256e71c3",
"en_raw": "Got a minute?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "d4e34a44",
"en_raw": "Why so formal?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "35c39b89",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "c9541741",
"en_raw": "Oh, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "98e15482",
"en_raw": "about what you said before..."
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6ba7c57a",
"en_raw": "There's something I want to ask"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "89812165",
"en_raw": "...It might be rude"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8dee74ad",
"en_raw": "to ask"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "13c38456",
"en_raw": "Aren't we two"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "cfea141b",
"en_raw": "a little alike?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "9a9f7602",
"en_raw": "...In what way?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f0bfa5fd",
"en_raw": "If only I were as cheerful"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "d288411f",
"en_raw": "as Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "2284489e",
"en_raw": "Sorry, sorry"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "b3e86cad",
"en_raw": "I didn't mean it that way..."
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "cb41cba3",
"en_raw": "But even though it looks like it"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "00a2005a",
"en_raw": "Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "24fda9e4",
"en_raw": "isn't carefree"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6c43ed1d",
"en_raw": "every day"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "19944998",
"en_raw": "Anyway"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "3e8e9829",
"en_raw": "What did you want to ask me?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "14f4b588",
"en_raw": "Sorry to be persistent"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "142e26da",
"en_raw": "But"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "0b7117c8",
"en_raw": "it matters to me"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "7a588f32",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "99c9c31b",
"en_raw": "What's your relationship with Nao Murase?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "e8edaf46",
"en_raw": "Relationship?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "36de84d5",
"en_raw": "...Here it comes"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "f19c9885",
"en_raw": "About Shiina, I"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "b9b47ab4",
"en_raw": "don't know her well, but..."
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "dbd925c1",
"en_raw": "You shouldn't badmouth Shiina"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "b18c1b4b",
"en_raw": "It'll touch"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "50481950",
"en_raw": "Nao's nerve"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "21852f6f",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "998036a3",
"en_raw": "Don't you have doubts?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "9a99869e",
"en_raw": "As for me,"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "7d8d23e4",
"en_raw": "...I have quite a few"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "cd98931a",
"en_raw": "Why does Murase"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "fd139329",
"en_raw": "choose Shiina?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "11e164b1",
"en_raw": "Sanjo, you're popular, aren't you?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f78ea055",
"en_raw": "It's healthier not to worry"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "55402b6e",
"en_raw": "about a small-minded guy like that"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "e84c663d",
"en_raw": "Actually, that's what I wanted"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "14102319",
"en_raw": "to say to Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "c8f3f424",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "21ff366b",
"en_raw": "You look pretty tired"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "3bdf5d67",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "bf113b1d",
"en_raw": "Let's be friends"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "1c12b620",
"en_raw": "Sorry... I"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "ad8e6e20",
"en_raw": "really am rude, aren't I..."
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "81af9888",
"en_raw": "I can't be as honest"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "eecb2fd7",
"en_raw": "as Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "18751593",
"en_raw": "Oh... ha ha"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "9ae35fa2",
"en_raw": "It's okay, it's okay"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "9f7b76e3",
"en_raw": "Tired of dog walks? Come to my place"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "611f548f",
"en_raw": "Let's hang out and blow off steam"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "29d9d627",
"en_raw": "Don't mind it, come anytime"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "a56e9dc3",
"en_raw": "I'll be waiting"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "e5ec4092",
"en_raw": "Sorry, maybe next time"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "a691fc76",
"en_raw": "...Sorry for the weird question"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "fa073f2c",
"en_raw": "Don't worry about it"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "b71edacc",
"en_raw": "Hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "d5c86c69",
"en_raw": "About the last"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "623a6863",
"en_raw": "Crusader, did you see it?"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "80e105aa",
"en_raw": "It was all flashbacks"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "d195e7da",
"en_raw": "but maybe that was setup?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "5977c320",
"en_raw": "Or filler..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "2df60dcb",
"en_raw": "What I think is"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "b5ce7c60",
"en_raw": "that Hiro and Sazuna, who regained"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "fe6a4911",
"en_raw": "their brotherly bond through battle"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "7af0f551",
"en_raw": "will defeat Kisana..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "d9a86cd5",
"en_raw": "It has to be that..."
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "47343911",
"en_raw": "But, but~"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "448181bd",
"en_raw": "Hiro's armpit, which peeks out"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "00e006f7",
"en_raw": "now and then from his jacket"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "5ddf86e3",
"en_raw": "is super cute, isn't it~"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "d393c467",
"en_raw": "...Don't talk about that at school"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "3dc1b88c",
"en_raw": "...Go away"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "4c54b02e",
"en_raw": "Don't brush me off~"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "bd73ddbe",
"en_raw": "Hey, Inagaki..."
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "10147234",
"en_raw": "Only a little longer"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "e44bf69f",
"en_raw": "until the convention"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "84736e5e",
"en_raw": "I'm super excited"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "4f8ef347",
"en_raw": "I'm going to look for the Sazuna x Hiro book~"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "a3992a51",
"en_raw": "Hey, hey, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "e582e929",
"en_raw": "Please look around with me for sure"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "cfa1c9b2",
"en_raw": "Sorry, my head's starting to hurt"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "1df58ad3",
"en_raw": "See you."
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "9e5e11db",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, what do you think?"
}
]
}